🧮 Understanding Model Specs
 
Term What It Means 
Parameters (B) "Brain size" — billions of connections. More = smarter but needs more RAM. 7B = great starting point. 
Context Window How much text it can "remember" in one conversation. 8K = short note. 128K = entire book. 
Quantization (Q4_K_M, etc.) Compression — smaller file, runs faster, slightly less accurate.  q4_K_M  = sweet spot for most. 
Instruct vs Base Always pick Instruct — trained to follow your commands. Base models = complete text, not chat. 
 
 
 
