🚀 Quick Start Commands
 
Just copy one line into Terminal — that's all it takes!
 
bash  
# ⭐ START HERE — Best all-rounder
ollama run llama3.2

# 🇹🇭 Best for Thai + long documents
ollama run qwen2.5

# ⚡ Fastest — quick answers
ollama run mistral

# 🧠 Better reasoning — more capable
ollama run llama3.1

# 📱 Lightweight — phones/old laptops
ollama run llama3.2:3b
 
 
 
 
📖 Quick Summary / บทสรุป
 
More expensive hardware ≠ better for everyone. The "best" model is the one that runs smoothly on YOUR computer and does what YOU need. Llama 3.2 7B is the sweet spot for most people — great quality, reasonable size. If you need Thai → Qwen 2.5. If you need speed → Mistral. If you're on a phone → Llama 3.2 3B. One size does NOT fit all — pick what works for you, and remember: you can always switch later. That's the beauty of local AI — choice is yours. 🧠✨
 
 
 
